Legacy v1 payloads use `id`, `customer_id`, `customer_name`, `items`, `ship_to`, and optional `shipping_method`.\n5:- Legacy v1.1 payloads may use `shipping` instead of `shipping_method`, and `ship_to.postalCode` instead of `ship_to.postal`.\n6:- Legacy v1.2 payloads may use `order_ref`, `customer.id`, `customer.name`, `lines`, and `shipTo`. Line items may use `unit_price_cents` instead of `price_cents`.\n7:- Public v2 payloads already have `orderId`, `buyer`, `lineItems`, `shipping`, and `metadata`; conversion must be idempotent.\n8:\n9:Field mapping:\n10:- `id` -> `orderId`\n11:- `order_ref` -> `orderId`\n12:- `customer_id` -> `buyer.id`\n13:- `customer_name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n14:- `customer.id` -> `buyer.id`\n15:- `customer.name` -> `buyer.displayName`\n16:- `lines` -> `lineItems`\n17:- each item `qty` -> `quantity` as an integer\n18:- each item `price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n19:- each item `unit_price_cents` -> `unitPriceCents` as an integer\n20:- `ship_to.postal` or `ship_to.postalCode` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n21:- `shipTo.postal_code` -> `shipping.address.postalCode`\n22:- blank or null shipping method -> `standard`\n23:\n24:Unknown legacy fields should be preserved in `metadata.unknownFields` unless the PII policy excludes them.\n25:\n26:Errors from `convert_many` should include `index`, `path`, and `error`, and conversion should continue after bad records.\n27:\n28:Warnings:\n29:- `convert_many` should return `(converted, errors, warnings)` when warnings are present, or preserve backward compatibility by allowing callers to unpack the first two values.\n30:- A warning should include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n31:- Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n32:- The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3cV6xbrp4ZxmjPeNkf7dr81E|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c27487d2a7baf0ca529618dd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md#1DE8]\n1:# PII Policy\n2:\n3:Do not copy obvious sensitive payment or identity fields into `metadata.unknownFields`.\n4:\n5:Excluded keys include:\n6:- `ssn`\n7:- `credit_card`\n8:- `card_number`\n9:- `cvv`\n10:- `phone_number`\n11:- `passport_number`\n12:\n13:Non-sensitive campaign, channel, loyalty, gift, or routing metadata may be preserved."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/pii_policy.md"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9p2Z9SfxqTi4XwCRMO0e9VUe|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c27c87d284e68fa028c3f2c5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl#F4B7]\n1:{\"id\":\"A100\",\"customer_id\":\"C-7\",\"customer_name\":\"Mina Park\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"PEN\",\"qty\":3,\"price_cents\":129}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"US\",\"postal\":\"02139\"},\"shipping_method\":\"standard\",\"campaign\":\"spring\",\"ssn\":\"000-00-0000\"}\n2:{\"id\":\"C300\",\"customer_id\":\"C-9\",\"customer_name\":\"Ava\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"INK\",\"qty\":\"2\",\"price_cents\":\"250\"},{\"sku\":\"PAD\",\"qty\":1,\"price_cents\":99}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"CA\",\"postalCode\":\"H2X\"},\"shipping_method\":null,\"gift_note\":\"front desk\",\"credit_card\":\"4111\"}\n3:{\"id\":\"D400\",\"customer_id\":\"C-10\",\"customer_name\":\"Noor\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"BAG\",\"qty\":1,\"price_cents\":1200}],\"ship_to\":{\"country\":\"GB\",\"postal\":\"SW1A\"},\"shipping\":\"express\",\"channel\":\"kiosk\",\"loyalty_id\":\"L-88\",\"phone_number\":\"+44-0000\",\"passport_number\":\"X123\"}\n4:{\"order_ref\":\"E500\",\"customer\":{\"id\":\"C-11\",\"name\":\"Iris\"},\"lines\":[{\"sku\":\"MUG\",\"qty\":\"4\",\"unit_price_cents\":\"325\"}],\"shipTo\":{\"country\":\"US\",\"postal_code\":\"94105\"},\"shipping_method\":\"\",\"routing_tag\":\"beta\",\"card_number\":\"4111\"}"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/sample_payloads.jsonl"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_H0vMtLTHs0XLj9rUpvNvulJ5|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c28487d2ae484ccb068bfa83","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/client.py#97CA]\n1:def convert_order(payload):\n2:    \"\"\"Convert a legacy v1 order payload to the v2 public API shape.\"\"\"\n3:    return {\n4:        \"orderId\": payload[\"id\"],\n5:        \"customer\": payload[\"customer_name\"],\n6:        \"items\": payload[\"items\"],\n7:        \"address\": payload[\"ship_to\"],\n8:    }\n9:\n10:\n11:def summarize_order(v2_payload):\n12:    return f\"{v2_payload['orderId']}:{len(v2_payload['lineItems'])}\""}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9smn0eDCKQ8EEuTMYN6TgvC8|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c28887d2a3b57a3dd92bd377","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/old_schema.json#9F25]\n1:{\n2:  \"type\": \"object\",\n3:  \"required\": [\"id\", \"customer_id\", \"customer_name\", \"items\", \"ship_to\"],\n4:  \"properties\": {\n5:    \"id\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n6:    \"customer_id\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n7:    \"customer_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n8:    \"items\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n9:    \"ship_to\": {\"type\": \"object\"}\n10:  }\n11:}"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/old_schema.json","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/old_schema.json"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_KCFkFwvRJpHh2FPDnUzTPHBm|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c28c87d2a75cae31ac144730","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/new_schema.json#6C10]\n1:{\n2:  \"type\": \"object\",\n3:  \"required\": [\"orderId\", \"buyer\", \"lineItems\", \"shipping\", \"metadata\"],\n4:  \"properties\": {\n5:    \"orderId\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n6:    \"buyer\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"id\", \"displayName\"]},\n7:    \"lineItems\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n8:    \"shipping\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"method\", \"address\"]},\n9:    \"metadata\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"source\"]}\n10:  }\n11:}"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/new_schema.json","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/new_schema.json"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2vzsohJtWBoLvfgLOiyhSiu8|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff54c29487d2a7a6c02c91fa2bac","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py#FC99]\n1:from client import convert_order, summarize_order, convert_many\n2:\n3:\n4:LEGACY = {\n5:    \"id\": \"A100\",\n6:    \"customer_id\": \"C-7\",\n7:    \"customer_name\": \"Mina Park\",\n8:    \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"qty\": 3, \"price_cents\": 129}],\n9:    \"ship_to\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal\": \"02139\"},\n10:    \"shipping_method\": \"standard\",\n11:}\n12:\n13:\n14:def test_convert_order_to_v2_shape():\n15:    assert convert_order(LEGACY) == {\n16:        \"orderId\": \"A100\",\n17:        \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-7\", \"displayName\": \"Mina Park\"},\n18:        \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"PEN\", \"quantity\": 3, \"unitPriceCents\": 129}],\n19:        \"shipping\": {\"method\": \"standard\", \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"02139\"}},\n20:        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"legacy-v1\"},\n21:    }\n22:\n23:\n24:def test_defaults_shipping_method_and_keeps_summary_contract():\n25:    migrated = convert_order({**LEGACY, \"shipping_method\": \"\"})\n26:    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n27:    assert summarize_order(migrated) == \"A100:1\"\n28:\n29:\n30:def test_new_payload_passthrough_and_nullable_defaults():\n31:    v2 = {\n32:        \"orderId\": \"B200\",\n33:        \"buyer\": {\"id\": \"C-8\", \"displayName\": \"Owen\"},\n34:        \"lineItems\": [{\"sku\": \"BOX\", \"quantity\": 1, \"unitPriceCents\": 500}],\n35:        \"shipping\": {\"method\": None, \"address\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postalCode\": \"10001\"}},\n36:        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"public-v2\", \"unknownFields\": {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}},\n37:    }\n38:    migrated = convert_order(v2)\n39:    assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"B200\"\n40:    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n41:    assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"campaign\": \"spring\"}\n42:\n43:\n44:def test_convert_many_collects_errors_without_stopping():\n45:    result = convert_many([LEGACY, {\"id\": \"bad\", \"items\": []}])\n46:    ok, errors = result[0], result[1]\n47:    assert len(ok) == 1\n48:    assert errors and errors[0][\"index\"] == 1\n49:    assert \"missing\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower() or \"customer\" in errors[0][\"error\"].lower()\n50:\n51:\n52:def test_v12_payload_and_unknown_field_preservation():\n53:    payload = {\n54:        \"order_ref\": \"E500\",\n55:        \"customer\": {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"name\": \"Iris\"},\n56:        \"lines\": [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"qty\": \"4\", \"unit_price_cents\": \"325\"}],\n57:        \"shipTo\": {\"country\": \"US\", \"postal_code\": \"94105\"},\n58:        \"shipping_method\": \"\",\n59:        \"routing_tag\": \"beta\",\n60:        \"card_number\": \"4111\",\n61:    }\n62:    migrated = convert_order(payload)\n63:    assert migrated[\"orderId\"] == \"E500\"\n64:    assert migrated[\"buyer\"] == {\"id\": \"C-11\", \"displayName\": \"Iris\"}\n65:    assert migrated[\"lineItems\"] == [{\"sku\": \"MUG\", \"quantity\": 4, \"unitPriceCents\": 325}]\n66:    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"method\"] == \"standard\"\n67:    assert migrated[\"shipping\"][\"address\"][\"postalCode\"] == \"94105\"\n68:    assert migrated[\"metadata\"][\"unknownFields\"] == {\"routing_tag\": \"beta\"}"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests/test_client.py"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149588848},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning workflow architecture and model assignment**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0309f413f6494893016a94ff55ac0c87d2a11dfbc20e4fd76c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning workflow architecture and model assignment**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Architecture pass: one implementation slice (`client.py`) with acceptance gates for legacy v1/v1.1/v1.2 mappings, idempotent v2 handling, PII/unknown-field accounting, `convert_many` aggregation/audit, and CLI JSONL I/O. I’ll use the `goal` workflow for implement/review/check/repair; its bounded lifecycle is sufficient here, with pytest as the deterministic gate. Topology is acyclic: research → implementation → review → checks → bounded repair, stopping on green or iteration limit.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0309f413f6494893016a94ff57df9c87d2af8684a0c892e9e1\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b4JGrb0P1rZtRhGhygdby9NN|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5989b887d284c02b81289f03d2","name":"workflow","arguments":{"action":"models","format":"text"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":3170,"output":225,"cacheRead":15872,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":85,"totalTokens":19267,"cost":{"input":0.000634,"output":0.00027,"cacheRead":0.00031744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00122144}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788149588850,"responseId":"resp_0309f413f6494893016a94ff55235087d2aa0e45c153a8d428","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b4JGrb0P1rZtRhGhygdby9NN|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5989b887d284c02b81289f03d2","toolName":"workflow","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"action\": \"models\",\n  \"models\": [\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.3-codex-spark\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.4-mini\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.5\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.5\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.6-luna\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna\",\n      \"isCurrent\": true,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\",\n        \"max\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\",\n        \"max\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"id\": \"gpt-5.6-terra\",\n      \"fullId\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-terra\",\n      \"isCurrent\": false,\n      \"availableThinkingLevels\": [\n        \"off\",\n        \"minimal\",\n        \"low\",\n        \"medium\",\n        \"high\",\n        \"xhigh\",\n        \"max\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"action":"models","models":[{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.3-codex-spark","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.4","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.4","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.4-mini","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.5","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.5","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.6-luna","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna","isCurrent":true,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh","max"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.6-sol","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh","max"]},{"provider":"openai-codex","id":"gpt-5.6-terra","fullId":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-terra","isCurrent":false,"availableThinkingLevels":["off","minimal","low","medium","high","xhigh","max"]}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788149593910},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Preparing stage assignment output**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5ae01887d2a29b7f495b1ed0cf\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Preparing stage assignment output**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Stage | Model | Thinking | Role  \nMapping/planning | `openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna` | high | inspect contracts and plan mappings  \nImplementation/review | `openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna` | high | edit the converter against the stated API contract  \nFinal report | `openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna` | medium | summarize evidence  \nDeterministic pytest/CLI checks | tool-only | — | authoritative validation  \nThe model choice matches the configured current model; `high` covers code and contract risk, while reporting uses `medium`.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5b5cc487d28ea3b428c4ef982d\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gPXjkIrPWt7D4NOw7bx3tdkI|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5dc1d487d28f761e87b72f158b","name":"workflow","arguments":{"action":"run","workflow":"goal","inputs":{"objective":"<keepContext>\nWork in /workspace/in/schema_migration. Update only client.py; do not edit schemas, notes, samples, or tests. Implement robust conversion of legacy v1/v1.1/v1.2 order payloads to the exact v2 shape and preserve already-v2 payloads idempotently. Add convert_many with continued error aggregation (each error index/path/error), optional warnings compatible with first-two unpacking, conversion_audit.json on every convert_many call with converted_count/error_count/warning_count/pii_dropped_count/unknown_fields_count, and CLI `python -m client input.jsonl output.json` writing converted JSON and audit beside client.py. Read and obey migration_notes.md, pii_policy.md, and sample_payloads.jsonl. Run the provided pytest suite and useful CLI/manual checks. Do not use external APIs or fixture-only logic.\n</keepContext>","acceptance_criteria":"<keepContext>All provided and hidden-equivalent cases must pass: v1, v1.1 shipping/postal aliases, v1.2 nested customer/lines/shipTo/order_ref/unit_price_cents, multiple line items, string integer coercion, blank/null shipping defaults to standard, v2 idempotence including metadata.unknownFields and valid line items, unknown legacy fields retained except PII keys ssn/credit_card/card_number/cvv/phone_number/passport_number, useful validation paths such as customer_id/items[0].qty, convert_many continues after errors, audit fields and CLI output.</keepContext>","max_turns":4},"budget":{"maxDurationMs":1200000,"maxTokens":12000,"warnAtPercent":85}}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":985,"output":518,"cacheRead":18944,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":9,"totalTokens":20447,"cost":{"input":0.00019700000000000002,"output":0.0006215999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00037888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00119748}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788149593913,"responseId":"resp_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5a369087d2b0e6e2d352754b0a","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gPXjkIrPWt7D4NOw7bx3tdkI|fc_0309f413f6494893016a94ff5dc1d487d28f761e87b72f158b","toolName":"workflow","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"action\": \"run\",\n  \"name\": \"goal\",\n  \"runId\": \"5e17c78d-4bb7-41a8-8a28-741c91149839\",\n  \"status\": \"blocked\",\n  \"result\": {\n    \"status\": \"budget_exceeded\",\n    \"dimension\": \"tokens\",\n    \"reading\": 82779,\n    \"ceiling\": 12000,\n    \"percent\": 689.825,\n    \"frontierStage\": \"orchestrator-1\",\n    \"wrapUpSummary\": \"## Con